              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The Standard bearer rides a warhorse and has a hand weapon, heavy armour and shield. Army Standard Bearer. In Late armies, characters’ warhorses may have cloth barding (+3).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
