              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Arrière Ban have improvised weapons and throw rocks. Levies. Subject to Warband rule# 4 and 5. They may not have a Standard or Musician, and may never declare a charge.</characteristic>
