              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Foot mercenaries have a hand weapon, thrusting spear and shield. They may have light armour (+2) and exchange thrusting spear and shield for crossbow (+1) or halberds (-1) or double-handed weapons (free). One unit of thrusting spear-equipped Foot Mercenaries may be upgraded to Brabançons (+5). Brabançons have WS4 and are Stubborn. Any Foot Mercenaries unit may be designated as Open Order.</characteristic>
